      "Each morning the team reviews payment posting accuracy arrivals, items waiting on the AR manager, and items ready for a verified close. Check that the owner is actually available before assigning. Escalate an item that has waited past the written threshold. Name the owner for every open item, including items waiting on someone else. Apply the same payment posting accuracy test to the reviewer note and to the value that survives in the payment file. Outsourced Billing Services treats a missing the request record as an open item, not as a passed check.",
      "A case with no next action is an exception even if it says in progress. Open the day with a queue pass by age, owner, and missing evidence. A clean-looking status is not evidence that the underlying work is correct. Record one next action and one due time per open item. The payment posting accuracy record should let a second reviewer rebuild the decision from the source document and the reviewer note. Outsourced Billing Services treats a missing the request record as an open item, not as a passed check.",
      "## Sampling and collection",
      "If the record does not match the surviving value, stop the dependent action and log the conflict in the payment file rather than choosing the more convenient value. A case that moves between owners should keep both owner periods visible. The record should show the source, the decision, and the surviving value in one place. Keep the failed attempt and the correction in the same history. The payment posting accuracy reviewer records the close entry, the owner, and the next action in one place. A payment posting accuracy handoff at Outsourced Billing Services ends only when the next reviewer can act from the written record.",
      "Record who released the dependent action and when. An escalation that ends in silence remains open. When access blocks the work, name the system, role, and approver. Keep the failed attempt and the correction in the same history. A payment posting accuracy exception keeps the close entry attached and routes the question to the AR manager. A payment posting accuracy handoff at Outsourced Billing Services ends only when the next reviewer can act from the written record.",
      "## Analysis and reporting",
